                                                "sense_id": "2a2a3841-b704-39a1-86f3-78d9481c30f9",
                                                "text": "The L Word banks on heteroflexibility as well as queer equivocation, through its cultivation of the touristic gaze, a gaze which immersed, identifies with, and distanced, desires."
